# rust's solver binding, through the smt-text runtime shim (runtime/smt-text.rs, a `z3 -in` process per script).
# Internal: smt-query.tree reaches it through `@term/test/native/{platform}/smt-text` and calls `evaluate-smt`.

dock load
  load <global:smt-text>, name smt-text

# Z3's answer to one SMT-LIB2 script. A task, never the dock alias found from smt-query.tree: `term test` builds the two
# as separate units, and a found alias reached smt-query's as an undefined `smtText` (item 1075)
task evaluate-smt
  mark async
  take script, like text
  like text
  send back
    call smt-text/evaluate
      read script
      wait true
